37847>>>>>>>>>>>                // If from child, this is a probably a parent Zoom from a Zoom.
37847>>>>>>>>>>>                Case Break
37848>>>>>>>>>>>
37848>>>>>>>>>>>            Case Else // must be nfUndefined
37848>>>>>>>>>>>
37848>>>>>>>>>>>        Case End
37848>>>>>>>>>>>
37848>>>>>>>>>>>        Send SetActionButtons
37849>>>>>>>>>>>
37849>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
