37995>>>>>>>>>                WebSet pbRender of oDetailButton to False
37996>>>>>>>>>                Case Break
37997>>>>>>>>>
37997>>>>>>>>>            Case Else
37997>>>>>>>>>                // UNDEFINED: vengo del Dashboard, muestro todo
